<![CDATA[Notes:]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[Uses the X8 port to transfer mapped data to and from an AB PLC as fast as 10ms, 32I - 32O Data REAL.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[Festo Positioning Basic EVO3 V3.5.10.x Festo Position Basic Library with CoDeSys SP12]]>
</Line>
